WEBVTT

00:02.002 --> 00:04.129
Acrobatic Silky?

00:06.131 --> 00:07.465
Ouch!

00:08.883 --> 00:10.593
Takakura-sama, are you all right?

00:10.677 --> 00:11.845
Ow.

00:12.512 --> 00:14.472
What a lewd state you are in!

00:14.556 --> 00:16.975
To expose yourself to me like that...

00:17.058 --> 00:19.936
It must mean you're presuming
a betrothal already!

00:20.020 --> 00:21.813
Very well!

00:21.896 --> 00:23.523
You have powers as well?

00:23.606 --> 00:28.028
I see, so that is why you were able
to enter our void space.

00:28.111 --> 00:30.864
We will take your banana
while we're at it.

00:30.947 --> 00:32.532
- Labor, labor...
- Hold on!

00:32.615 --> 00:33.908
Let me put something on!

00:33.992 --> 00:36.327
Takakura-sama, I will deal with them!

00:36.411 --> 00:40.081
Full of defects, covered in mud,
that's fine, that's fine.

00:40.165 --> 00:43.543
Yup, that's fine, that's fine, now... Labor!

00:46.629 --> 00:48.548
Serpoian Form Serpo-Grammetry!

00:52.886 --> 00:53.762
Wait up!

00:53.845 --> 00:56.264
Don't include me in your attack!

00:56.347 --> 00:59.559
You're a cheap hire. There are
countless replacements for you.

00:59.642 --> 01:00.977
What was that just now?

01:01.061 --> 01:03.605
I feel like I crashed
into an invisible wall.

01:04.147 --> 01:05.732
Snap!

01:06.232 --> 01:09.277
Chiquitita, you have a dream?
Shy my chotchiki for you.

01:09.360 --> 01:12.447
Chiquitita, you wake from a dream?
Shy my chotchiki for you.

01:13.239 --> 01:14.616
This is...

01:14.699 --> 01:15.950
This is...

01:16.534 --> 01:18.161
Where are the clothes?

01:18.244 --> 01:20.872
Jet Punch!

01:25.168 --> 01:27.253
That's a respectable punch.

01:27.337 --> 01:29.464
Thank you, deez!

01:29.547 --> 01:33.051
But if it doesn't connect,
it's not much of anything.

01:33.134 --> 01:34.844
Snap!

01:36.429 --> 01:37.806
TAKAKURA

01:38.556 --> 01:40.391
Serpoian Form Serpo-Grammetry!

01:41.059 --> 01:42.477
Hold it! Stop that!

01:42.560 --> 01:43.686
What a nuisance!

01:44.187 --> 01:47.232
You seem to be in love with me.

01:47.315 --> 01:48.525
Not one bit.

01:48.608 --> 01:52.779
I'm sorry. I already have
someone in my heart.

01:52.862 --> 01:56.574
But I'll give you as many chances
as you need to try to win my heart.

01:57.158 --> 01:58.409
That is...

02:01.454 --> 02:03.748
the conditions of an attractive lady.

02:03.832 --> 02:06.334
Argh! My head is stuck!

02:06.417 --> 02:08.336
Now, I'll take the nuisance...

02:11.631 --> 02:15.135
I have caught you, woman person.

02:15.218 --> 02:17.595
What is this? It's going to crush me!

02:17.679 --> 02:19.097
You just thought,

02:19.180 --> 02:23.101
"You can use psychic powers
even without saying Serpo-Grammetry," yes?

02:23.184 --> 02:24.644
I don't care about any of that!

02:24.727 --> 02:28.189
I didn't overlook the fact
that you dropped your guard.

02:28.273 --> 02:30.275
I don't care about that!
Just let me out of this!

02:30.358 --> 02:32.152
But this is quite interesting.

02:32.235 --> 02:36.197
There are multiple persons
with special powers in the same location.

02:36.281 --> 02:39.701
There is hope for us
to seek further evolution.

02:39.784 --> 02:41.953
Your movements are remarkable...

02:42.036 --> 02:44.330
...but you are not all too powerful.

02:44.414 --> 02:49.335
This wasn't in the plans, but we will take
your banana as well while we're at it.

02:49.419 --> 02:53.047
I am the chosen one!
I won't lose to the likes of you!

02:53.131 --> 02:56.342
- The light of hope will come from--
- Chiquitita-chi!

03:03.808 --> 03:07.186
That's right. You have been chosen.

03:07.270 --> 03:09.188
Chosen for our evolution.

03:09.272 --> 03:10.899
Now, let's begin.

03:10.982 --> 03:12.525
Hold on just a second!

03:26.748 --> 03:28.416
You were after me, weren't you?

03:30.335 --> 03:32.253
I'll take you on right now!

03:33.504 --> 03:35.882
Takakura-sama! You're still...

03:35.965 --> 03:39.469
There are things that are
more important than clothes!

03:47.685 --> 03:50.021
Man, I hate this. I wanna go home...

03:50.104 --> 03:54.442
That's right, that's right.
We want your banana.

03:54.525 --> 03:55.610
However...

03:56.194 --> 03:58.863
We can do both of you simultaneously.

03:58.947 --> 04:01.157
As long as there are three of us.

04:02.283 --> 04:03.785
This is...

04:03.868 --> 04:06.579
The transformation is wearing off.

04:06.663 --> 04:10.083
This is possible when the three of us
combine our psychokinesis.

04:10.667 --> 04:12.418
The Awesome Zone.

04:13.711 --> 04:14.629
Inside this area...

04:14.712 --> 04:15.797
...all transformations...

04:15.880 --> 04:17.173
...let alone standing up...

04:17.257 --> 04:18.508
...will be impossible.

04:18.591 --> 04:19.842
- However...
- ...this...

04:19.926 --> 04:21.135
- ...has...
- ...one...

04:21.219 --> 04:22.512
...flaw.

04:22.595 --> 04:25.223
We cannot enter there, either.

04:25.306 --> 04:26.641
Thus...

04:29.060 --> 04:33.439
We will have him beat you up
until you can no longer move.

04:33.523 --> 04:36.401
Stop that! If you do that, he'll die!

04:36.484 --> 04:39.070
Please, stop!

04:53.042 --> 04:53.876
Impossible!

04:53.960 --> 04:55.461
He broke through the Awesome Zone?

04:55.545 --> 04:56.504
No, he didn't!

04:56.587 --> 05:00.341
Our psychokinesis
is being repelled by someone!

05:00.425 --> 05:02.427
Oh no! The woman person is here!

05:03.011 --> 05:05.388
Momo-chan, I really missed you.

05:05.471 --> 05:06.889
Okarun, you moron!

05:06.973 --> 05:09.309
Don't you be making out with that bitch!

05:09.976 --> 05:13.396
I'd never forget your damn faces!

06:51.452 --> 06:53.788
Momo-chan, I really missed you.

06:53.871 --> 06:56.082
Shut up! Don't look at me, you perv!

06:56.165 --> 06:58.501
Until we harvest the man person's banana...

06:58.584 --> 07:01.712
...we wanted the woman person
under confinement! That's what we told it!

07:01.796 --> 07:03.548
What exactly is that thing doing?

07:03.631 --> 07:07.260
It's annoying that Momo Ayase
is rescuing me, but I have no choice.

07:07.343 --> 07:08.511
You shall lend us a hand!

07:08.594 --> 07:10.096
Wait, is that Acro-Silky?

07:10.179 --> 07:13.808
I'll help you out, but I won't let you
have Ken Takakura-sama!

07:15.268 --> 07:16.519
Miss Ayase!

07:16.602 --> 07:18.729
Come on, Momo Ayase! What are you doing?

07:18.813 --> 07:20.606
You have to hold them back
with your magic!

07:20.690 --> 07:23.317
I don't know how,
but we have the advantage!

07:23.401 --> 07:26.028
Let's wake up the Gig Worker now!

07:26.112 --> 07:29.240
Damn it! Do your job properly
or we'll lower your pay!

07:29.323 --> 07:31.617
Sorry, this is a bit impossible.

07:31.701 --> 07:34.036
You're such a bother!

07:34.954 --> 07:37.165
No! Anything but that!

07:37.248 --> 07:39.459
Stop!

07:40.877 --> 07:44.881
Yellow and black is the mark of courage

07:44.964 --> 07:48.092
Are you able to fight 24 hours

07:48.176 --> 07:52.054
Regain, Regain, our own Regain

07:52.138 --> 07:56.309
The mark of courage on our briefcases

07:56.392 --> 07:59.979
Can you fight far off in a distant world

08:00.062 --> 08:01.814
Business Man

08:01.898 --> 08:04.025
Business Man

08:04.108 --> 08:07.778
Japanese Business Man

08:13.826 --> 08:15.411
- That's right!
- Take them...

08:15.495 --> 08:16.537
...and beat them up...

08:16.621 --> 08:18.498
...so they can't move anymore!

08:20.958 --> 08:22.919
Man, you irritate me.

08:24.295 --> 08:27.048
You mention that name, you die.

08:27.715 --> 08:28.549
So powerful!

08:28.633 --> 08:30.760
Our psychic powers are being pushed back!

08:30.843 --> 08:34.180
Gig Worker! Go after that woman person!

08:34.263 --> 08:38.184
I won't let you.
You're not going to ignore me.

08:38.267 --> 08:39.519
Makes me wilt.

08:39.602 --> 08:43.189
If we don't have that
psychic thing going, it's all ours!

08:43.272 --> 08:44.982
Salary...

08:45.066 --> 08:46.150
Uppercut!

08:48.027 --> 08:49.320
I can't see the attack!

08:49.403 --> 08:50.738
That thing is bad news!

08:51.531 --> 08:52.615
Mantis!

08:55.284 --> 08:56.619
He dodged!

08:56.702 --> 08:59.622
I can see this thing's punches.

08:59.705 --> 09:00.706
Mantis!

09:04.043 --> 09:08.965
You said that I am lacking in power,
didn't you?

09:11.300 --> 09:12.426
Then...

09:13.052 --> 09:16.556
I'll simply nail
your weak spot multiple times.

09:16.639 --> 09:19.016
I am one with Takakura-sama!

09:19.100 --> 09:21.060
Hey! You guys are way too close!

09:21.143 --> 09:23.062
You guys will both get blown away!

09:23.145 --> 09:24.355
Oh my, are you jealous?

09:24.438 --> 09:25.314
As if!

09:25.398 --> 09:27.525
Momo-chan, that's great advice.

09:27.608 --> 09:29.318
I am an awkward fellow, after all.

09:31.153 --> 09:32.738
Do you guys wanna die?

09:32.822 --> 09:34.031
I'm sorry, Miss Ayase!

09:34.115 --> 09:35.491
Come on, get a grip already!

09:35.575 --> 09:38.202
You're the one in charge of holding back
their weird powers!

09:38.286 --> 09:40.413
Sheesh, you are so useless.

09:40.496 --> 09:42.957
Your pay will be cut by 60 percent.

09:43.040 --> 09:44.917
N-No way.

10:02.351 --> 10:03.686
What was that just now?

10:04.228 --> 10:05.062
Water!

10:05.146 --> 10:06.355
My feet don't touch the bottom!

10:06.439 --> 10:08.190
What's going on here?

10:12.528 --> 10:15.114
The wall and ceiling is all water now!

10:22.496 --> 10:23.831
Crap.

10:30.504 --> 10:33.382
It's here.

10:38.095 --> 10:39.430
Crap!

10:39.513 --> 10:40.931
We're gonna escape for now!

10:41.015 --> 10:44.352
Hold on! Why are you calling the shots?
I'm the leader here!

10:44.435 --> 10:45.770
It's Nessie!

10:45.853 --> 10:48.064
Takakura-kun is getting excited.
He's so cute.

10:48.147 --> 10:49.273
Damn you guys!

10:49.357 --> 10:52.360
No, we're in Kamigoe City,
so should I call it Kamissie?

10:52.443 --> 10:55.613
Oh, fine! Then you guys can get
real chummy and stare at Nessie!

10:55.696 --> 10:56.614
I'm outta here!

10:56.697 --> 10:59.075
Oh, so that thing is called Nessie?

10:59.158 --> 11:00.951
Takakura-kun, you know so much.

11:01.035 --> 11:03.287
Come on! What have you been doing?

11:03.371 --> 11:06.832
You weren't able to hold back
the woman person at all!

11:06.916 --> 11:09.251
You're also getting a 60 percent pay cu--

11:16.050 --> 11:17.009
How could you?

11:17.093 --> 11:18.260
Nessie is really bad news!

11:18.344 --> 11:20.721
- Why are you attacking us?
- That's what I've been saying!

11:20.805 --> 11:22.723
You're supposed to get
that woman person over there!

11:22.807 --> 11:24.392
Hey! Takakura-kun, wait...

11:28.062 --> 11:29.355
Miss Shiratori!

11:31.524 --> 11:32.942
That was from him?

11:33.025 --> 11:34.318
Business Punch!

11:35.444 --> 11:37.988
Does he punch harder underwater?

11:38.072 --> 11:41.367
Is he a Mantisian that has
the characteristics of a mantis shrimp?

11:41.450 --> 11:42.451
Mantis! Mantis!

11:43.536 --> 11:47.456
Yours truly can exert
real power underwater!

11:47.540 --> 11:51.127
The underwater punching power
of yours truly is ten times that on land.

11:52.586 --> 11:53.671
Huh?

11:59.468 --> 12:00.803
Ten times!

12:00.886 --> 12:02.388
Still need air, huh?

12:02.471 --> 12:03.514
Get him!

12:04.140 --> 12:07.601
You should be able to swim at pretty high
speed with Turbo Granny's leg strength!

12:07.685 --> 12:09.061
Makes me wilt.

12:15.192 --> 12:16.235
I'm gonna die!

12:16.819 --> 12:17.945
I can't swim!

12:18.028 --> 12:20.030
Turbo Granny can't swim!

12:20.114 --> 12:21.323
Huh?

12:27.288 --> 12:28.706
This is the worst situation ever!

12:28.789 --> 12:30.583
How are we supposed to fight like this?

12:30.666 --> 12:32.460
I don't know the answer either!

12:32.543 --> 12:34.128
We're in trouble if we take too long!

12:34.211 --> 12:36.422
If we don't hurry up and save
that stupid girl, she'll drown!

12:36.505 --> 12:38.174
Miss Ayase,
what about your psychic powers?

12:38.257 --> 12:40.342
I can reach if we're right below her,

12:40.426 --> 12:42.470
but that mantis shrimp guy
is in the way and I can't get close!

12:42.553 --> 12:44.722
Then I'll draw that guy's attention,

12:44.805 --> 12:46.724
so please grab Miss Shiratori
in the meantime!

12:46.807 --> 12:48.017
What are you talking about?

12:48.100 --> 12:51.520
If you just plunge in like that, you'll
end up exactly like that stupid girl!

12:51.604 --> 12:53.189
Don't make things harder for me, okay?

12:53.272 --> 12:54.732
You don't have to say it like that!

12:54.815 --> 12:57.318
I'm just trying to make myself useful!

12:57.401 --> 12:59.612
And it doesn't mean jack
if you cause even more trouble!

12:59.695 --> 13:01.864
That's why I said
we need to hurry up and run!

13:01.947 --> 13:03.908
You guys are at fault
for making out all the time!

13:03.991 --> 13:04.950
We weren't making out!

13:05.034 --> 13:07.036
You've been making out! This whole time!

13:07.119 --> 13:09.205
You pinned her down on the ground
in the courtyard!

13:09.288 --> 13:10.706
So it was bothering you!

13:10.789 --> 13:11.874
No, it's not!

13:11.957 --> 13:15.044
I don't care what some liar
is doing with some stupid girl!

13:15.127 --> 13:16.504
Hold on a second!

13:17.963 --> 13:21.467
If you actually care,
then tell me honestly that you do!

13:22.218 --> 13:25.721
If it's weighing on your mind,
please let me explain myself!

13:26.388 --> 13:29.642
I don't care how much other people
will take things the wrong way,

13:29.725 --> 13:32.353
but I don't want you
to have the wrong idea, Miss Ayase!

13:32.436 --> 13:35.439
I want you to have a proper
understanding of everything!

13:38.192 --> 13:40.069
Don't touch me, pervert!

13:40.152 --> 13:41.320
Oh, sorry.

13:41.403 --> 13:43.572
How can you say that
when you look like that?

13:43.656 --> 13:44.657
Miss Ayase!

14:02.007 --> 14:04.009
I'm sorry! That was beyond my control!

14:04.093 --> 14:05.678
I won't touch you ever again!

14:05.761 --> 14:06.804
That's a great idea!

14:06.887 --> 14:07.805
Huh?

14:08.389 --> 14:09.723
Okarun, stay still!

14:09.807 --> 14:10.975
Huh?

14:11.058 --> 14:12.184
This is rough.

14:12.810 --> 14:14.728
All right, let's try it.

14:14.812 --> 14:16.855
Stop with your futile resistance!

14:17.773 --> 14:20.317
What the hell is that?

14:20.401 --> 14:24.029
I grab Okarun really hard,
and push him forward!

14:24.113 --> 14:27.283
I propel him with my psychic powers
as if I'm catching a lively fish,

14:27.366 --> 14:29.368
and ride it!

14:29.451 --> 14:34.331
You can't escape attacks from yours truly!

14:34.415 --> 14:37.459
Get up there!

14:52.099 --> 14:53.309
That's amazing!

14:53.392 --> 14:54.810
Miss Ayase, you're such a genius!

14:54.894 --> 14:56.103
I know that!

14:56.186 --> 14:57.980
Hey, come on. Wake up!

14:58.898 --> 15:01.233
She probably swallowed a lot of water.

15:01.317 --> 15:02.943
Don't hate me for this, okay?

15:03.027 --> 15:04.403
Forced resuscitation!

15:05.279 --> 15:06.947
Miss Shiratori! I'm glad!

15:09.825 --> 15:10.868
Is this a dream?

15:10.951 --> 15:13.621
You dumbass!
We haven't resolved anything yet!

15:13.704 --> 15:16.290
Take your clothes off! It's hard to
move you when there's water resistance.

15:16.373 --> 15:17.249
Huh?

15:17.333 --> 15:19.668
I've already decided I'm not
stripping down until my wedding night!

15:19.752 --> 15:20.878
Strip!

15:23.881 --> 15:26.550
It's not fair that you escaped upwards!

15:26.634 --> 15:30.346
Oh, right now yours truly
has them cornered.

15:30.429 --> 15:33.557
Give me a bit more time.

15:36.352 --> 15:37.519
What?

15:37.603 --> 15:39.730
Each and every one of you are useless!

15:40.314 --> 15:45.486
His attack power is amazing, but he's
so stupid he assaults everything in sight.

15:45.569 --> 15:48.572
Gig Worker has high attack power
underwater,

15:48.656 --> 15:51.700
but he takes too many breaths
and the enemy ends up escaping.

15:51.784 --> 15:52.952
Sorry.

15:53.035 --> 15:56.288
That's enough. This is a case
where we will all merge together.

15:56.372 --> 15:59.917
We will use this Body Cable to become one.

16:00.000 --> 16:01.085
YOU MUST ASSUME RESPONSIBILITY

16:01.168 --> 16:02.753
You have to assume responsibility.

16:02.836 --> 16:05.756
Takakura-kun, you saw me in lingerie.

16:05.839 --> 16:06.590
I did not.

16:06.674 --> 16:09.635
You in lingerie is only worth
one piece of candy.

16:09.718 --> 16:12.304
Anyway, I need both of you
to get fired up!

16:12.388 --> 16:14.848
We can't win unless we all use
everything we've got!

16:14.932 --> 16:15.724
Sure.

16:15.808 --> 16:18.477
Don't tell me what to do! I'm the leader!

16:18.978 --> 16:19.812
Here goes!

16:19.895 --> 16:21.522
One, two...

16:43.252 --> 16:47.131
What a shame. Ran out of water.

16:50.801 --> 16:52.428
That was close!

16:52.511 --> 16:54.972
What was that? Is that even possible?

16:57.474 --> 17:00.477
Miss Ayase, look at that!
It's pooling water into its neck!

17:00.561 --> 17:02.980
So it can't shoot continuously!

17:03.063 --> 17:03.897
Which means,

17:03.981 --> 17:06.859
if we break that thing's neck,
it can't shoot lasers anymore!

17:06.942 --> 17:07.985
Let's do it!

17:08.068 --> 17:10.904
Now might be our chance!
Let's get close and attack!

17:28.047 --> 17:30.507
You just thought we only had

17:30.591 --> 17:33.052
the high-compression water blast,
didn't you?

17:33.135 --> 17:38.223
We may look like this, but we are
a close-combat in-fighter UMA.

17:41.435 --> 17:42.061
Oh no!

17:55.157 --> 17:57.743
Hey, get a grip! Are you okay?

17:59.286 --> 18:01.997
That hurt! I'm not okay!

18:02.081 --> 18:03.457
Then you're fine!

18:03.540 --> 18:06.627
That thing has the punching guy's arm!

18:06.710 --> 18:09.922
When did they merge together?
We can't get close like that!

18:10.005 --> 18:12.174
That damn Serpoian

18:12.257 --> 18:15.552
brought the punching guy
to cover for Nessie's weakness all along!

18:15.636 --> 18:18.931
It's too strong! Laser beams
and mantis shrimp punches...

18:19.014 --> 18:22.351
We might've had a chance on land,
but there's nothing we can do underwater!

18:22.434 --> 18:23.644
Okarun, what'd you just say?

18:23.727 --> 18:25.270
There's nothing we can do!

18:25.354 --> 18:26.396
Not that one!

18:26.480 --> 18:28.273
You said mantis shrimp punches?

18:42.538 --> 18:43.747
Too bad.

18:43.831 --> 18:47.126
The high-compression water blast
has run out yet again.

18:47.209 --> 18:50.921
But we have endless ways to kill you.

18:51.004 --> 18:53.340
You are a very dangerous person,

18:53.423 --> 18:56.218
so we will kill you first
then dissect you.

18:56.301 --> 19:00.806
We can simply wait for you to drown
but we have used a bit too much time.

19:00.889 --> 19:03.725
Can we punch you to death?

19:20.742 --> 19:22.536
W-What?

19:22.619 --> 19:23.871
What is going on here?

19:23.954 --> 19:28.375
You shouldn't have merged together
with that Mantisian.

19:28.458 --> 19:31.378
A mantis shrimp's punching powers
are unparalleled underwater.

19:31.461 --> 19:35.048
But on land, it can never
unleash a punch at full strength.

19:35.132 --> 19:36.300
Including him.

19:36.842 --> 19:39.720
If he tried to go all-out,
he'd have ended up like you now.

19:39.803 --> 19:43.724
He'd have imploded
from the impact of his own punch.

19:49.062 --> 19:52.858
I can stay underwater like this
for hours on end!

19:52.941 --> 19:54.943
But what about you?

19:55.903 --> 19:57.029
Will you drown first?

19:57.112 --> 20:01.158
Or will you be severed
by the high-compression water blast first?

20:10.417 --> 20:12.836
I can't swim.

20:12.920 --> 20:15.714
But if there's a path to run...

20:16.423 --> 20:17.925
I can go full throttle.

20:18.008 --> 20:19.259
Hold on just a second!

21:08.558 --> 21:09.851
We're back?

21:11.770 --> 21:13.355
We defeated them?

21:17.818 --> 21:20.821
The ground is hard. This is the hallway!

21:21.321 --> 21:24.074
Thank you, hallway.

21:24.157 --> 21:25.951
Thank you for being so hard!

21:27.828 --> 21:29.621
What's that about?

21:31.248 --> 21:33.542
I dunno. It's hilarious.

21:34.501 --> 21:35.335
Huh?

21:35.419 --> 21:36.336
What are they doing?

21:36.420 --> 21:39.423
These guys are buck-naked and hugging!

21:43.093 --> 21:45.762
Ayase from Class B
and that four-eyes are going at it!

21:45.846 --> 21:47.347
No!

21:47.431 --> 21:50.183
No!

21:50.267 --> 21:53.895
The prim Miss Shiratori
from Class D is naked, too!

21:53.979 --> 21:55.355
Why is this happening?

21:55.439 --> 21:57.524
Why are they all naked?

23:28.448 --> 23:29.950
Nessie was simply too wicked!

23:30.033 --> 23:31.618
Was it a surviving Plesiosaur?

23:31.701 --> 23:34.079
But I never thought
it would merge with an alien.

23:34.162 --> 23:36.456
The merger between an UMA and
an alien is like a dream for me!

23:36.540 --> 23:37.833
Takakura-kun, you know so much.

23:37.916 --> 23:40.293
Next episode,
"Have You Ever Seen a Cattle Mutilation?"

23:40.377 --> 23:42.921
Man, I was caught in a weird situation.
This really sucks!
